infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Match the symptom to the stage
  desc "Slow at which stage?" is the first diagnostic question — each failure mode lives at one stage with one fix
  lists
    - label Syntax error
      desc Parse stage — pure text problem, schema irrelevant. Fix the SQL text.
    - label relation/column does not exist
      desc Analyze stage — valid SQL, no catalog match. Fix the name.
    - label Sudden slowdown after a bulk load
      desc Plan stage — stale row estimates, bad plan. Run ANALYZE to refresh statistics, do not rewrite the query.
    - label Always slow, plan looks right
      desc Execute stage — genuinely reading too many pages. Add an index or read less data.
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
